In Lab 1 we discovered a confounder. In Lab 2 we accepted that
prediction is the only honest objective when the DGP cannot be
manipulated. In Lab 3 we change the DGP itself.

**Today's roadmap:**

| Step | Method | Question it answers |
|:----:|:-------|:--------------------|
| 1 | **DAGs** | What is the structural reason the OLS estimate is biased? |
| 2 | **A/B-test design** | What study design removes the bias by construction? |
| 3 | **Difference-in-Differences** | When randomisation is impossible, what quasi-experiment helps? |
